sequenceDiagram
    actor Librarian
    participant UI as Blazor loans page
    participant App as Lending use case
    participant Rules as Pure lending rules
    participant DB as SQLite transaction
    participant Hub as NotificationsHub
    participant Member as Member browser
    Librarian->>UI: Confirm return
    UI->>App: ReturnAsync(authenticated actor, loanId)
    App->>App: Check Librarian role
    App->>DB: Begin write transaction
    App->>DB: Load open loan, copy, waiting reservations
    alt Already returned or invalid record
        App->>DB: Roll back
        App-->>UI: Expected failure result
    else Valid return
        App->>Rules: Calculate final fine using saved rate
        Rules-->>App: Fine in minor units
        App->>DB: Close loan and release copy
        App->>Rules: Select oldest waiting active member
        Rules-->>App: Next reservation or none
        alt Reservation exists
            App->>DB: Set reservation Ready with 72-hour deadline
            App->>DB: Set copy Reserved; save notification
        else No waiting member
            App->>DB: Set copy Available
        end
        App->>DB: Save and commit
        App-->>UI: Success
        opt Notification saved
            App->>Hub: Notify recipient after commit
            Hub-->>Member: LibraryChanged
            Member->>App: Reload own notifications
        end
    end
